      "hizbQuarter": 119,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2177,
      "text": "His companion said, while conversing with him, “Do you disbelieve in He Who created you from dust, then from a sperm-drop, then fashioned you into a well-proportioned man[24]?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 18,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الكَهۡفِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Kahf",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Cave",
        "numberOfAyahs": 110,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 37,
      "juz": 15,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 298,
      "ruku": 256,
      "hizbQuarter": 119,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2178,
      "text": "As for me: He is Allah, my Lord, and I do not associate anyone with my Lord.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 18,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الكَهۡفِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Kahf",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Cave",
        "numberOfAyahs": 110,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 38,
      "juz": 15,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 298,
      "ruku": 256,
      "hizbQuarter": 119,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2179,
      "text": "If only you had said, when you entered your garden, ‘This is by Allah’s Will; there is no power except with Allah.’ Even though you see me as inferior to you in wealth and children,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 18,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الكَهۡفِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Kahf",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Cave",
        "numberOfAyahs": 110,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 39,
      "juz": 15,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 298,
      "ruku": 256,
      "hizbQuarter": 119,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2180,
      "text": "it may well be that my Lord will give me something better than your garden, and send upon your garden a thunderbolt from the heaven, turning it into a barren land.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 18,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الكَهۡفِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Kahf",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Cave",
        "numberOfAyahs": 110,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 40,
      "juz": 15,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 298,
      "ruku": 256,
      "hizbQuarter": 119,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2181,
      "text": "Or its water may sink, so you will never be able to get it back.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 18,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الكَهۡفِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Kahf",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Cave",
        "numberOfAyahs": 110,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 41,
      "juz": 15,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 298,
      "ruku": 256,
      "hizbQuarter": 119,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2182,
      "text": "Eventually, all his produce was destroyed and he started wringing his hands [in dismay] over what he had spent on it, as it had collapsed on its trellises, and he said, “Oh, would that I had not associated anyone with my Lord!”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 18,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الكَهۡفِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Kahf",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Cave",
        "numberOfAyahs": 110,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 42,
      "juz": 15,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 298,
      "ruku": 256,
      "hizbQuarter": 119,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2183,
      "text": "He had none to support him against Allah, nor could he support himself.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 18,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الكَهۡفِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Kahf",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Cave",
        "numberOfAyahs": 110,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 43,
      "juz": 15,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 298,
      "ruku": 256,
      "hizbQuarter": 119,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2184,
      "text": "In that situation[25], the authority only rests with Allah, the True God. He is best in reward and best in outcome.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 18,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الكَهۡفِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Kahf",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Cave",
        "numberOfAyahs": 110,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 44,
      "juz": 15,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 298,
      "ruku": 256,
      "hizbQuarter": 119,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2185,
      "text": "Give them the example of the life of this world: it is like the plants of the earth, thriving when sustained by the rain We send down from the sky, but soon they turn into chaff scattered by the winds. Allah has full power over all things.",
